  - Now your cards! I understand we all like new toys but dont go too crazy! As powerful
    as they are, the more powerful they are the more the suspicion is raised on you! 
    Go ahead! Click!
  - You survived the first week! Careful though, the network is getting a little
    suspicious of your current movement...
  - How do you keep doing this? You clearly meant everything you said in the job
    description
  - You're getting close! Just one more week to go!
  - OH MY GOD I CAN SMELL THE MONEY!
